id: TRANS-007
ilities: [authenticity]
source: cpm
maturity: 2
action: block
title: Git SSL verification disabled (MITM risk)
category: transport
severity: error
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .sh .yml .yaml .env .gitconfig
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ vendor/ node_modules/ .git/ build/ dist/
  content_contains: GIT_SSL
patterns:
  - regex: GIT_SSL_NO_VERIFY\s*=\s*(true|1)|http\.sslVerify\s*=\s*false
    message: "Git SSL verification disabled — enables MITM on git operations"
fix: Fix the certificate or configure a custom CA bundle with GIT_SSL_CAINFO. Never disable SSL verification for git operations.
